# Thu muc nay chi de Docker build co dung thu muc.
# Key that KHONG duoc commit - xem .gitignore dong "keys/*.pem".
#
# Vi sao can thu muc nay: backend Dockerfile co lenh
#   COPY keys ./keys
# Neu thu muc khong ton tai trong build context, Docker build fail ngay.
# Tren VPS file that co that roi, nhung khi build tren may chay GitHub
# thi thu muc phai duoc dua vao git - it nhat mot file rong.
#
# Key JWT that duoc sinh tren tung moi truong (lenh sinh: xem README).
